window.products.push({"id":948101,"name":"50\" Hanging Garment Bags for Closet Storage, Clear Garment Bags, Dust-Proof Breathable Suit Bags, 4\" Gusseted Larger Capacity Clothing Bags for Coats,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ha6lgacqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☛【Visible & Breathable Fabric】—— The front side of our hanging garment bags is made of transparent PEVA. Its transparent nature allows you to know what is inside at a glance and pick out the clothing you are looking for without any fuss. The back and sides of the hanging garment bags are made of breathable non-woven fabric, which easily allows fresh air in and out and has good breathability. ☛[Reusable Garment Bag]——The hanging clothes are made of thick PVC and non-woven fabric. The sturdy and tight stitches on the edge of the high-density fabric ensure the durability and sturdiness of the garment cover, which is greatly extended In addition to the service life of the garment bag, the garment bag can also be washed with water, so the garment bag can be reused. ☛【4\" Gussest Large Capacity garment bags】—— 50 x 24 x 4 inches, Quantity: 5pcs. Suitable for storing shirts/coat/short dress/medium top. Each garment bags has 4\" gussetes, which are wider than standard bags, the capacity is roomy enough to hold 4 winter coats or 10 T-shirts in one bag without getting squished at the bottom. ☛【Zipper and Small Holes】—— The garment bags for hanging clothes travel built in high-quality zippers, which is made of metal material electroplating process, which is sturdy and durable. There is a small opening on the top of the storage bag, which can only allow the hanger hook to pass through, which can prevent the entry of flying dust and is convenient for daily use. ☛ 【More Space Saving】—— Hanging clothing storage bags can store 8 shirts or 4-6 sweaters or 3-5 winter jackets, which can free up your closet space, allowing you to store more clothes in your limited closet, and can also keep the closet tidy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ha6lgacqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vicbuy","source_asin":"B09JNJ18WH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JNJ18WH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JNJ18WH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
