window.products.push({"id":948252,"name":"CDN TCF400 - Candy & Deep Fry Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZA3xnUjIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Keep track of the temperature when making candy or deep frying with CDN's TCF400 thermometer. Made from durable laboratory glass, it has a non-mercuric column and a stainless steel clip. The temperature guides on the thermometer and sheath have color-coded scales to help you find the ideal temperature. Best of all, it is waterproof and heat safe up to 400 degrees Fahrenheit. Candy making requires precise temperature control for best results. Unlike water, syrup temperature does not increase in a smooth manner when it is heated — syrup “pauses” at a certain temperature. Because of this, it is important to observe the temperature at all times when heating candy syrup. Deep Fry Tips: Make sure that the oil is at the correct temperature before adding food. CAUTION: Add food carefully to avoid splattering the hot oil. Use enough oil. When food is added, it lowers the temperature of the oil. Small quantities of oil will cool at a faster rate than larger quantities. Frying at lower temperatures results in lighter color, less flavor development and increased oil absorption. Caution: The TCF400 has a glass housing. Let it cool while clipped to the pot or place it on a dry cloth. DO NOT set a hot thermometer on a cold or wet surface. Featuring advanced technology, quality construction, easy-to-read displays and user-friendly operations, CDN thermometers are essential tools in any kitchen. CDN covers the thermometer with a five-year limited warranty. Amazon.com Turn out perfect candies, jelly, and caramelized sugar with this stove-top thermometer by CDN. Made of durable laboratory glass, the 8-inch-long thermometer precisely measures temperature with a non-mercuric column in both Fahrenheit and Celsius, in a range from 75 to 400 degrees Fahrenheit (25 to 200 degrees Celsius). Excellent also at monitoring hot oil for deep frying doughnuts, onion rings, and other foods, the thermometer can be attached firmly to the side of any size fry vat or candy pan with its sliding stainless-steel clip. Highlighted sections of the thermometer show the best temperatures for different candy stages, specifically thread, soft ball, firm ball, hard ball, soft crack, hard crack, and caramel, along with deep frying. Dishwasher-proof, the thermometer comes with a protective sheath and is covered by a five-year warranty against defects. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZA3xnUjIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CDN","source_asin":"B000095RBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000095RBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000095RBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":948253,"name":"Mid Century Modern Retro Abstract Drink Coaster Gift Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GteOIKS1L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 fabric coasters with gold, turquoise, olive green and rusty orange designs as seen in the first photo. Not only can you protect your furniture but now you can decorate it with our fabulous coasters. These coasters have a printed fabric top with a black rubber back. The design is printed to look like a woven fabric but it is actually smooth. These would make a great addition to any mid century modern decor.  We think coasters make the perfect gift because there really isn't anyone who cant use coasters. Each set comes in a clear plastic box ready for gift giving. Makes a great housewarming or hostess present.  Our original designs are printed onto a fabric covered rubber. You can toss and and bend it. Its just like the classic neoprene mousepad material. They are 1/4\" thick and sturdy. not flimsy at all. We do the printing here at our home studio in Las Vegas Nevada USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GteOIKS1L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08KNWFKVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KNWFKVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KNWFKVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
