window.products.push({"id":948260,"name":"The orignal SOUQLAB silicone popcorn maker with lid, BPA Free, Microwave popocorn popper and dish washer safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PLry6ce9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you like to eat popcorns? And tried saucepans, pots, and many expensive machines that are worthless and only for prepackaged popcorns? and now looking for a better way to make popcorn without using microwave bags or other expensive machines.SOUQLAB's new innovative design collapsible silicone popcorn popper will be the perfect solution for all your problems that helps you in making popcorns within 2-4 minutes without being worried about the chemicals. Now say Goodbye to prepacked additives or flavors, it’s time to make healthy popcorns at home within minutes and enjoy eating it with your friends and family members while watching movies or seasons.Our silicone popcorn bowls are professionally made from food-grade silicone material with silicone LID and built-in HANDLES to easily remove them from the microwave. Our popcorn popping bowl for microwave is designed in a way that they can spread heat evenly so you will get delicious popcorns.The collapsible design will allow you to keep this in your dishwasher, kitchen drawer, cupboards, etc without taking too much space. Our microwave popcorn cooker bowls are available in various colors, you can Purchase multiple quantities for popcorn bars at Graduations, Birthday Parties, and Weddings, or bring the theater home and kick back with a movie, your kids, and your very own healthy custom popcorn!Instructions for use: 1. Expand the popper to its full height. 2. Pour kernels up to the upper line to get the bowl filled; If up to the lower line, then get half bowl popcorn. 3. Place the lid loosely inside the bowl (supposed to rise while cooking) 4. Microwave at high heat for 2-4 minutes, until popping slows to 3 seconds in between pops. 5. Using the handles, carefully remove the bowlCaution, it is HOT! 6. Drizzle with oil/butter or seasoning, toss and enjoy popcorns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PLry6ce9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09L815C9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L815C9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L815C9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
