window.products.push({"id":948412,"name":"Vintage Retro Old Fashioned Decorative Quiet Second Hand, Metal Chicken Figurine Shaped Quartz Analog Large Numerals Desk Clock, Battery Operated Easy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-IWXqY-hL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Description: This is an exquisite handmade chick clock. The chick keeps its eyes fixed ahead, just like searching for something. With its tail rolled, there are a great number of details. .The sculpture deliberately adopts retro craftsmanship to have a vintage effect. After several processes, it is finally formed. The clock was added into the classic design, which made the product not only a decoration gift but more practical. It is suitable for a variety of decoration spaces. Features: The product is 5.9 inches in length, 2 inches in width and 5.9 inches in height. The product is powered by one AA battery, and the clock has no alarm function. The index dial is carved with Roman numerals, which shows the retro style. The sculpture deliberately adopts retro craftsmanship to have a vintage effect after several processes, which is unique and creative. It is not only a delicate ornament but also a practical clock. Suitable for living room, study room, bedroom and other interior spaces, enlightens your home decoration. Specifications: Material: Iron Color: Coffee Product size: 15 * 5 * 15cm / 5.9 * 2 * 5.9in Package size: 16 * 6 * 16cm / 6.3 * 2.4 * 6.3in Product weight: 133g / 4.7oz Package weight: 430g / 15.2oz Package list: 1 * Chick Clock(Battery is not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-IWXqY-hL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Galapara","source_asin":"B07PLPQRWV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PLPQRWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PLPQRWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":948413,"name":"Circulon Teakettle, 2 Quart, Royal Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s7U3fbuaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tea and Coffee are more than on, they're Circulon, with the sleek and smartly-designed Circulon 2-Quart morning bird teakettle, featuring cutting-edge style in this essential for every contemporary kitchen. Circulon unites stovetop functionality with modern design for the well-balanced kitchen and the well-balanced life, and this morning bird teakettle delivers both. The stain-resistant enamel-on-steel kettle heats up to 8 Cups of hot water quickly and efficiently, perfect for several portions of pour-over Coffee or a large pot of steaming matcha or herbal tea. The teakettle's melodic whistle sounds when water comes to the boil, and the squeeze-and-pour handle with a textured rubber grip places the spout's lever at your fingertips for one-hand operation. The shapely form and sleek exterior Color add a welcome touch of easy-to-clean style to everyday kitchen function, as do all the smart-designed Circulon cookware and kitchenware products. Around the clock, make morning Coffee, afternoon tea, and any hot-beverage time simpler and more stylish with the colorful Circulon 2-Quart morning bird teakettle on the stove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s7U3fbuaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circulon","source_asin":"B07Q76ZCXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q76ZCXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q76ZCXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
