window.products.push({"id":948417,"name":"SHOWLIVEU Clock Wall Decor Large Peacock Wall Clock 23.6 inch Metal Design Non-Ticking Silent Art Digital Wall Clocks for Living Room Dining Room Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EkHRJuyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The luxurious wall-mounted pendulum clock presents a unique European style with elaborate carvings and a charming appearance. This uniquely shaped, richly colored wall pendulum clock adds glamour to your room like an elegant work of art. It uses a silent sweeping second movement, running at only 20-30 decibels, bringing you and your family a quiet and comfortable environment. Unique Pendulum: The delicate pendulum features two cute little animals and bright rhinestones embellished on it. As the uniqueness of this vintage wall clock. It will add a little pizzazz to your home decor. Application This wall-mounted pendulum clock is suitable for living rooms, hallways, bedrooms, and other places. It is not only a wall clock but also a good decoration. Specification Material: PVC, Metal Color: Blue, Beige Style: European, Retro Time Display: Analog Indoor/Outdoor: Indoor Power Supply: 1AA Battery Mounting Type: Wall Mount Process: Injection Molding, Painting Operating Decibels: 20-30 DB Gross Weight: 1.8kg/3.96lbs Package Size: 50*41*13cm/19.68*16.14*5.1 Product Size: 37*60cm/14.57*23.62in Clock Plate Height: 46cm/18.11in Size of Glass: 19*25cm/7.48*9.84in Installation 1.Direct the hook at the top holes, and make sure they match. 2.Tighten the screws to fix the hook. 3.Put the two stands into the bottom holes of the back cover. 4.Insert one AA battery. 5.Turn the handset knob of the movement to set the time. 6.Hang the pendulum on the hook carefully. 7.Just find a place to hang on this clock. Package Included 1*Wall-mounted Pendulum Clock 1*Pendulum 2*AA Batteries All Accessories Needed for Installation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EkHRJuyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHOWLIVEU","source_asin":"B0B6HMM4YG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6HMM4YG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6HMM4YG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
