window.products.push({"id":948579,"name":"Window Elements Ashville Printed Extra Wide 54 x 84 in. Rod Pocket Sheer Curtain Panel, Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eKTrMM+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add style and elegance to any living space with sheer curtain panels. Ashville printed sheer curtain panels add decorative style, filter light and create privacy for any room in your home. Update your existing drapes by adding a layer of sheer curtains or hang two or more panels on their own to let in just enough light during the day and provide sheer coverage at night. Easy to hang rod pocket header measures 2O to accommodate up to a 1.5 inch curtain rod. Hang two or more sheer panels for desired fullness and style. Perfect for bedroom, living room, dining room and kitchen, sheers are a versatile alternative to heavy drapes. Solid color sheers add subtle color to a child's room or nursery. Each panel offers extra-wide 54 inch coverage in 84 inch length. Includes on sheer curtain. Coordinating curtain scarf sold separately. Hang two or more printed sheer panels and the coordinating valance to create a complete designer look. Decorative rod sold separately. Easy care, machine wash cold, delicate cycle with mild detergent. 100% polyester. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eKTrMM+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Window Elements","source_asin":"B00NHIK6JC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NHIK6JC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NHIK6JC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":948580,"name":"Kuhn Rikon COLORI Chef's Knife with Safety Sheath, 6 Inch, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712lDVL8gbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Any serious kitchen needs a selection of good knives. Whether it’s chopping, slicing, dicing or mincing, an effective knife makes food preparation a whole lot easier and faster. Kuhn Rikon’s collection of COLORI knives tick a lot of boxes - ultra-sharp, highly versatile, safe, colourful and easy to clean. Available in a range of shapes and sizes that include paring (straight and serrated), utility, bread, chef’s and Santoku designs, there is a blade for any job. Every knife within the Swiss-designed assortment features an easy-grip handle and a non-stick coating that allows the cutting surface to glide seamlessly and consistently through food. And that’s not all: COLORI knives are accompanied by a sheath/cover for safe storage in kitchen drawers and for taking your knife out and about when needed (barbecues, parties, on vacation etc).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712lDVL8gbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUHN RIKON","source_asin":"B0882BG6D5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0882BG6D5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0882BG6D5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
