window.products.push({"id":948647,"name":"Cozyel Pasta Dumpling Maker Stainless Steel Automatic Electric Noodle Machine Pasta Press Maker Dough Roller Noodle Cutting Machine For Commerical/Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":228.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n8NP37QSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Description: This series machines have many advantages. For example, they have beautiful appearance, advanced structure.They are also very convenient for operation, and have high work efficiency with stable and safe system.They can bemused to press different kinds of noodles, ravioli husk and so on.This machine is suitable for press paste in hotel, restaurants, food processing factories and families.The thickness of the dough of this noodle pressing machine is at most 5mm, it is not recommended to make steamed buns, which require thicker dough. Suitable for noodles, wonton skin, dumpling skin etc.110V US Plug, English manual is included. Specifications: Rated voltage: 110VRated input power: 370-550WEngine power: 370-550WMaterial: Stainless steelDough knife length: 18cmNoodle width: 3mm / 9mmThe thickness of the dough:1-20mm(0.04-0.79inch)Producing capacity: 15-20kg/h Daily Maintenance: Keep it dry after out of using for long time to avoid rusty.After finish processing, clean the machine and remove paste which left on the parts, in order to avoid dry flour influence the next using.Check electric wore regularly to avoid leakage.Inject little plant-oil on transmission parts to ensure it smoothly. Package Including 1 x Noodle Press Machine1 x English manual Note: After you receive the Noodle Press Machine, you must clean it before use. Wash it with vinegar then with detergent, then wash it with water, and then make a dough and press it repeatedly in the machine. Every corner must be pressed until no impurities come out. Thank you for your understanding!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n8NP37QSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozyel","source_asin":"B09J59BRKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J59BRKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J59BRKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
