window.products.push({"id":948714,"name":"13.4'' Natural Woven Fruit Basket Bowl with Wooden Base, Handmade Seagrass Wicker Decorative Bowl Chic Rustic Boho Decor Wall Hanging, Great Housewarm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91exIsRQQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️UNIQUE TABLE CENTERPIECE BOWL CUM BOHO BASKET WALL DECOR - Our woven basket bowl is the beautiful organizer, bread and fruit serving basket bowl or coffee table ornament. Thanks to its artistic woven art, the basket is often used as rustic woven basket wall decor. You can easily hang the basket bowl on the wall as an eye-catching boho chic wall decor for your kitchen, living room, bedroom, dining room or hallway. ✔️BEAUTY AND FUNCTION - This wicker woven baskets blend traditional Vietnamese weaving art with practically modern utility. It makes them the perfect decorative centerpiece bowl for your dining or coffee table and wall decor. It adds character and a touch of natural, rustic boho beauty to many styles of table and home decor. ✔️UNIQUE HOUSEWARMING GIFT - The beautiful woven bowl makes it an ideal housewarming gift or birthday gift for minimalist, natural, boho rustic style enthusiasts or those who love cooking and home decor. All of our products are handmade, so the actual pieces may vary slightly in color and size from the images shown online. ✔️EARTH-FRIENDLY – Made Terra hand woven table serving and decorative wall hanging basket bowls are made of seagrass, a plant that’s sustainably grown and easy to harvest. Seagrass is widely used by artisans to make home décor furniture and accessories. This is a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and serving table solution. ✔️YOUR PURCHASE MAKES AN IMPACT – MadeTerra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. Our woven bowls are masterfully hand woven by skilled artisans in Phu Vinh, a 400-year-old village nestled 25 kilometers outside of Hanoi, Vietnam. By purchasing a maker-to-market product, you knowingly support Vietnamese artisan communities, help preserving indigenous crafts & cultures and promoting greater equity in World Trade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91exIsRQQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B08JGGQF44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JGGQF44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JGGQF44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
