window.products.push({"id":948826,"name":"CangWU Whisk Milks Frother Handheld Mini Electric Stirring Rod Kitchen Supply for Coffee Matcha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XTTs-I3qS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: stainless steel, ABS Color: silver, black Length: 20 cm/7.9 inches Type: Mini Hand Mix Occasion: Kitchen Weight: 53g  Features 1. It is battery driven, convenient and fast 2. The hand-push switch is comfortable to hold, making milk froth effortless 3. The stainless steel mixing head is easy to clean and the milk frothing efficiency is high  how to use Step 1: Pour milk into the cup (Note: It is best to pour whole milk into the 1/4 of the cup, too much or too little milk will affect the density of the milk foam) Step 2: Heat the milk (Note: This step is to better produce dense milk froth. Although cold milk can also make milk froth, milk with a temperature of 40 to 60 degrees can have a better effect) The third step: foaming (note: tilt the cup body 45 degrees into the milk liquid 1/3 of the depth of the mixing head, about 30 seconds to beat the milk) Step 4: Pour the whipped milk froth into the coffee Step 5: After use, rinse the milk stains on the hair directly with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XTTs-I3qS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CangWU","source_asin":"B08PVQBYDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PVQBYDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PVQBYDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
