window.products.push({"id":948882,"name":"2 Pcs Best Wooden Spatula Set Kitchen Slotted Turner Flat Wood Wok Spatula Non Stick Cooking Utensils for Frying Mixing Fish Spatula Turner Black Egg ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61boPCkiY4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Healthy Wood: The spatula set are made of food-grade teak wood, because of the uniqueness of the wood, it appears unique original color and grain. No BPA, PVC or toxic finishes. Scratch-Free, Non-Stick Spatula: Wood does not scratch or scrape non-stick coatings and they don't heat up when left in a pot or pan, and they don’t transfer any off taste to the food. These non-scratch wooden spatula prevents scratches and damage to expensive non-stick pans and pans. Multi Use: Includes 1 slotted spatula and 1 solid spatula which are very suitable for daily use. The edges of the flipper end are tapered so you can easily get under food for flipping and turning. It's been great for mixing batter, burger flipping, grilled cheese flipping, and taco making to name a few things. One-Piece Wood Construction: Each wooden spatula is a single-piece design, which means that there's no crevices for bacteria to fester and all sorts of other things that make you uneasy. This also means that there's no need to disassemble/assemble as part of cleaning or storage. Comfortable Handle: It is ergonomically designed, the handle is nice and thick which makes it very comfortable to hold. It is also very sturdy so you can stir up thick soup or break up meat without worrying about breaking the handle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61boPCkiY4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ayiaren","source_asin":"B0BFF2L3F5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFF2L3F5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFF2L3F5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
