window.products.push({"id":948976,"name":"【Official Authentic】 RENPHO True HEPA Replacement Filter for RP-AP088W/RP-AP088B, 4-Stage Filtration System, Especially for improving Moist Conditions","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711YxyMsnjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Only Fit the RENPHO True HEPA Air Purifier model RP-AP088W and RP-AP088B: Taking into account the functions of improving moist conditions. Please Note: Size 7.6*7.6*6.2 inches LxWxH, Exclusively designed for RP-AP088 air purifier. Upgraded 5-Stage Filtration: Compared with the 3-stage filtration system of other brands, RENPHO HEPA air purifiers for bedroom upgrades to 5-stage filtration system (pre-filter, intercept coating, true HEPA filter, carbon filter, net filter) can effectively relieve uncomfortable symptoms caused by airborne contaminants by capturing small airborne particles such as dust, smoke, pollen, dander, pet hair. Filter Change Indicator: The replacement indicator flashes in red to remind you to replace the air filter. We highly recommend replacing the filter every 6-8 months depending on the usage frequency and the air quality to ensure the best results. 2 kinds of genuine RENPHO replacement filters for your selection. Search \"RP-AP088-F1\" for pet allergy (pre-installed), and \"RP-AP088-F2\" for Moist Conditions (sold separately). Effective Purification: The compact frame and 360° air intake help RENPHO air purifier for allergies 088 the air wherever you put it, refreshing the air 5x per hour in rooms as large as 240 sq.ft (22㎡). Air purifier perfect for bedrooms, living rooms, nurseries, kitchens, dorms, offices, etc. Fan speeds of air cleaner for bedroom are adjustable in 1, 2, 3 stages. Quiet Sleep Operation & Timer: With the lowest 24db white noise, this air cleaners for bedroom won't affect your sleep, work or study. It is perfect for a restful and soothing indoor environment. 3 timers options (2h/4h/8h) enables the air purifier to run only when you need it. The lock function avoids error operation. White light and multi-color changing light mode offer a gentle and calming glow for children and pets, accompany them through bedroom time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711YxyMsnjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RENPHO","source_asin":"B0BGLNTDT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGLNTDT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGLNTDT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
