window.products.push({"id":948984,"name":"Flaming Fire Truck Theme Plates and Napkins Serves 16 With Birthday Candles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810HPobYnDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM BIRTHDAY NAPKINS AND PLATES: Our set of brightly colored birthday napkins and plates set contains 16 plates and 16 napkins. Perfect for hot and cold food. It will make that cute addition to any party or occasion. A fantastically-themed party table set that also includes 24 birthday candles in 4 colors from LLILYKAI VALUE BUNDLES that creates the perfect mood for the birthday celebration. ULTIMATE USAGE: Perfect for all ages birthday parties from 1st to 16th to 21st, use our set at any special occasion which is great for outdoor summer gatherings, BBQ's, garden or beach suppers and any party you may want to have. Guaranteed to enhance and brighten up every event with its brilliantly colorful design. HIGH QUALITY: Our birthday plates and napkins party supplies are produced with top quality materials. The birthday napkins are made of quality paper, and the party plates are made thick and sturdy with white card which makes it durable yet practical. And they are folded around the outer edge to give it additional strength. The birthday plate can hold up to any meal. DIMENSIONS: These disposable 16 themed party plates are approx. 9 inch in diameter, while these party plates are cute and decorative, they are strong enough to handle even the heaviest of any event foods and snacks. Paired with these high quality 16 themed party luncheon napkins approx. 6.5 inch when folded and 13\" when unfolded. SAVE TIME AND ENERGY: These happy birthday plates and napkins are easy to clean up. Since they are all disposable there is no worries about all the dishes so you can then enjoy the party with your families. FLAMING FIRE TRUCK THEMED: Our party plates and napkins are sure to be a hit with the amazing theme of Flaming Fire Truck on both the happy birthday plates and the napkins. Your child is sure to just love all the thrilling Flaming Fire Truck graphics. Your party will be the hit of everyone there with these awesome Flaming Fire Truck party plates and napkins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810HPobYnDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JJ Party Supplies","source_asin":"B079J6DY4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-948984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079J6DY4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079J6DY4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
